     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Os pacotes PCNM, packfor e spacemakeR que estavam sendo desenvolvidos na página do R-forge foram descontinuados e não foram atualizadas para a versão 3.0 do R. Agora o que dá pra fazer é baixar o zip, abrir a pasta com as funções e dar um source nelas uma por uma.... <div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>espero ter ajudado,</div><div>Diogo</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">Em 30 de janeiro de 2014 21:15,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">r-eco...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> escreveu:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-weight:bold;color:#222222;padding:0px\"> \r\n  <a name=\"m_2452920819505047818_143e56f4927c8e43_digest_top\" style=\"color:#222222\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resumo do tópico de hoje</a></div>\r\n<p>Grupo: <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-ecologia/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-ecologia/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244070969000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_h8u9E7GxxpwHPs1UsLOF\">http://groups.google.com/group/r-ecologia/topics</a></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2452920819505047818_143e56f4927c8e43_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Instalação de pacotes</a> [1 atualização]</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_2452920819505047818_143e56f4927c8e43_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-ecologia/t/ed62a5549beb007d\" style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-ecologia/t/ed62a5549beb007d&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244070969000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1R1V7FmwExPt_ukRdU3zBg\">Instalação de pacotes</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n    <ul>\r\n      <span>&quot;Adriano S. Melo&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">asm.ad...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Jan 30 04:02PM -0200\r\n       <br> <br>\r\n      Ariane,<br>\r\nTente instalar os pacotes deldir e spdep separadamente. Depois tente<br>\r\ninstalar o PCNM novamente.<br>\r\nabraço,<br>\r\nAdriano<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\n2014-01-29 Ariane &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ariane...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n <br>\r\n\r\n      <p> </p>\r\n    </font></span></ul><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n  \r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nEnvie um código mínimo reproduzível.<br>\r\nEnvie ou responda perguntas para o e-mail (<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">r-eco...@googlegroups.com</a>)<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nVocê está recebendo esta mensagem porque se inscreveu no grupo &quot;R-Ecology&quot; dos Grupos do Google.<br>\r\nPara cancelar a inscrição neste grupo e parar de receber seus e-mails, envie um e-mail para <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">r-ecologia+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisite este grupo em <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-ecologia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-ecologia&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244070970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wFGA40VsZoUl4QikJMUB8\">http://groups.google.com/group/r-ecologia</a>.<br>\r\nPara obter mais opções, acesse <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244070970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3AiIFTonbNU6dg2kbGwq3b\">https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"text-align:left\">Sincerely,</div><b><div style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Diogo Borges Provete</b></div></b><b><div style=\"text-align:left\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></span></div></b><div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><b style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><a href=\"http://diogoprovete.weebly.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://diogoprovete.weebly.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244070970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw300qIyrM-3Qs1AnHeO34NH\">Personal web page</a></b></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\">PhD candidate at PPG Ecology and Evolution | Departament of Ecology | Institute of  Biological Sciences - ICB 1 | Universidade Federal de Goiás, campus II | Goiânia-GO | 74001-970| Brazil | Lab Phone <a href=\"tel:+55%2062%203521-1732\" value=\"+556235211732\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+55 62 3521-1732</a> | <b><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">Cel Phone +55 </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">62 8231-5775 | Skype: </span>diogoprovete <br>\r\n\r\n</div><div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"text-align:left;font-size:medium;margin-right:165px\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left;font-size:medium;margin-right:165px\">\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.herpetologynotes.seh-herpetology.org/index.html\" style=\"font-size:small\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.herpetologynotes.seh-herpetology.org/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244070970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_wLtzgs0xF-pOxqeqMKCn\">Herpetology Notes</a><span style=\"font-size:small\"> |</span> <a href=\"http://biozoojournals.3x.ro/nwjz/index.html\" style=\"font-size:small\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://biozoojournals.3x.ro/nwjz/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244070970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wbwmIlnqg_3KKTIvRLuW-\">NorthWestern Journal of Zoology</a><font>| </font><a href=\"http://checklist.org.br\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://checklist.org.br&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244070970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2gL5_38S5x31zcQvLeM5hr\">Checklist</a><br>\r\n\r\n</div></span><div style=\"text-align:left;margin-right:165px\"><br></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
